    <title>Study demonstrates potential anti-aging effect in GLP-1 drugs</title>
    <id>https://lzon.ca/news/news-000029-glp1-aging/</id>
    <link href="https://lzon.ca/news/news-000029-glp1-aging/"/>
    <published>2026-10-19T12:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2026-10-30T12:00:00Z</updated>
    <author><name>Lzon</name></author>
    <summary type="html" xml:base="https://lzon.ca/news/news-000029-glp1-aging/">&lt;p&gt;Researchers from the University of California analyzed data from a recent study to determine if semaglutide had anti aging effects. They discovered that study participants who received the drug had non-trivially improved markers of biological aging.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;</summary>
